    'Eight distinct sanctuaries along the Bangkok Noi Canal — from intimate Signature rooms to private canal villas and wellness retreats, each crafted for those who appreciate the extraordinary.': '沿曼谷诺伊运河分布的八处独特圣地——从温馨的标志性客房到私人运河别墅和健康疗愈庄园，每处均为欣赏非凡之美的人士精心打造。',
