    'For the ultimate elite experience, couples can opt for an exclusive resort buy-out, transforming our private canal villas into a secluded, romantic sanctuary for the wedding party and guests.': '为了打造终极精英体验，新人可选择独家包场，将我们的私人运河别墅转变为婚礼队伍和宾客的世外桃源式浪漫圣地。',
    'For weddings, galas and corporate elegance — panoramic canal views with full event planning support.': '适合婚礼、晚会和企业活动——全景运河景观，配备完整的活动策划支持。',
    'Friend or Family': '朋友或家人',
    'From giant slides and canal market visits to traditional Thai cooking classes and temple excursions — our concierge team will help you create the perfect family itinerary.': '从大型滑梯和运河市场参观，到传统泰式烹饪课和寺庙游览——我们的礼宾团队将帮助您打造完美的家庭行程。',
