    'Nestled along the historic Bangkok Noi Canal in Nonthaburi, our dedicated Wedding Concierge team transforms your dream wedding into a flawless reality.': '坐落于暖武里历史悠久的曼谷诺伊运河畔，我们专属的婚礼礼宾团队将您梦想中的婚礼变成无可挑剔的现实。',
    'Nestled along the tranquil Bangkok Noi Canal in Nonthaburi—just a short private boat ride from Bangkok\'s vibrant city centre—W1@Bangkoknoi is a resort of rare calm and character.': '坐落于暖武里宁静的曼谷诺伊运河畔——距曼谷繁华市中心仅需短暂的私人游船——W1@Bangkoknoi是一处难得的宁静与特色兼备的度假村。',
