    'One of Thailand\'s most sacred daily rituals, Tak Bat takes place at dawn as saffron-robed monks walk the canal path to receive alms.': '泰国最神圣的日常仪式之一，化缘（Tak Bat）在黎明时分进行，身着橘黄色袈裟的僧侣沿运河小径行走化缘。',
    'Open daily 9:00 AM – 9:00 PM': '每日开放 9:00 – 21:00',
    'Open-air dining under the stars with gentle breezes drifting from the Bangkok Noi Canal. Lantern-lit evenings and a serene waterway setting make our terrace ideal for romantic dinners and relaxed gatherings.': '在繁星下露天用餐，感受从曼谷诺伊运河飘来的轻柔微风。灯笼点缀的夜晚和宁静的水道环境，使我们的露台成为浪漫晚餐和轻松聚会的理想场所。',
    'Our King WhirlPool Villas offer an unparalleled waterfront experience — a private in-villa whirlpool, outdoor living pavilions, direct canal access, and panoramic views that evolve from golden sunrise to starlit evening. The ultimate expression of Thai luxury.': '我们的King WhirlPool别墅提供无与伦比的滨水体验——私人室内按摩浴缸、户外生活亭阁、直达运河通道，以及从金色日出到繁星夜晚不断变换的全景视野。泰式奢华的终极体现。',
    'Our Signature Garden Queen rooms offer a serene retreat with warm Thai-modern interiors, thoughtfully appointed furnishings, and a garden-facing outlook that brings the natural beauty of our tropical grounds to your doorstep.': '我们的标志性花园女王房提供宁静的休憩体验，配备温馨的泰式现代室内装饰、精心配置的家具，以及面向花园的景观，将我们热带园地的自然之美带到您的门前。',
    'Our chefs at Thai Boran create bespoke wedding menus ranging from royal Thai tasting journeys to international fusion banquets, all featuring seasonal ingredients sourced from canal-side markets.': 'Thai Boran的厨师团队为您创作定制婚礼菜单，从泰式皇家品鉴之旅到国际融合宴会，全部采用来自运河边市场的时令食材。',
    'Our concierge team will help you curate the perfect itinerary — from a sunrise paddle board session to a full-day canal boat journey.': '我们的礼宾团队将帮助您策划完美行程——从日出时分的站立式桨板到全天运河游船之旅。',
    'Our dedicated Events Concierge team works closely with you at every stage — from initial brief to final bow. Seamless, high-impact event delivery is what we do.': '我们专属的活动礼宾团队在每个阶段都与您紧密合作——从初始简报到最终谢幕。无缝、高影响力的活动交付是我们的专长。',
    'Our most expansive retreat, the Wellness Villa is a luxury 2-bedroom sanctuary designed exclusively for wellbeing. In-villa spa treatments, a meditation space, canal-side yoga deck and bespoke wellness programmes are all at your disposal — ideal for families or groups seeking the ultimate restorative escape.': '我们最宽敞的疗养庄园，健康别墅是专为健康疗愈而设计的豪华双卧室圣地。别墅内水疗疗程、冥想空间、运河边瑜伽平台和定制健康计划一应俱全——非常适合寻求终极恢复性休闲的家庭或团体。',
    'Our most expansive room category, the Deluxe King Suite features a separate living area, lush tropical garden views, and an in-room soaking tub. A genuine retreat within your retreat.': '我们最宽敞的房型——豪华大床套房，配备独立起居区、郁郁葱葱的热带花园景观和室内浸泡浴缸。度假中的真正避静之所。',
    'Our premier indoor space, offering sophisticated design and versatile configurations to suit any occasion — from grand galas and conferences to elegant seated banquets. Equipped with full professional audiovisual technology and staging.': '我们的旗舰室内空间，以精致设计和多种配置满足各种场合——从盛大晚会和会议到优雅的正式宴会。配备完整的专业视听技术和舞台设备。',
    'Our team will prepare your offering of rice and traditional food, guide you through the correct protocol, and help you participate meaningfully in this beautiful ancient practice.': '我们的团队将为您准备米饭和传统食物供品，指导您遵循正确的礼仪，帮助您有意义地参与这一美丽的古老习俗。',
    'Our website is not directed at children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.': '我们的网站不针对13岁以下的儿童。我们不会故意收集儿童的个人信息。',
    'Our website may contain links to third-party sites, including our booking and payment partners. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those websites.': '我们的网站可能包含第三方网站的链接，包括我们的预订和支付合作伙伴。我们不对这些网站的隐私实践负责。',
