    'Sacred conch shell and blessed water provided': '提供神圣法螺和圣水',
    'Savour authentic Thai Boran — traditional Thai dishes reimagined with modern elegance. Our signature restaurant and bar, set on the historic Bangkok Noi Canal in Nonthaburi, is an invitation to slow down and discover.': '品味正宗Thai Boran——以现代优雅重新诠释的传统泰式菜肴。我们的招牌餐厅和酒吧坐落于暖武里历史悠久的曼谷诺伊运河畔，是放慢脚步、细细探寻的邀请。',
