    'Direct booking advantage: Book directly with us for the best available rate, complimentary early check-in (subject to availability), and priority requests.': '直接预订优惠：直接与我们预订可享受最优惠价格、免费提前入住（视客房状况而定）以及优先处理特殊请求。',
    'Dress code: modest attire, shoulders and knees covered. Respectful silence observed during the ceremony.': '着装要求：着装保守，遮盖肩膀和膝盖。仪式期间保持庄重沉默。',
    'Drinking water, cold towels & hand fans': '饮用水、冰毛巾和手扇',
    'Each dish tells the story of Thailand\'s culinary heritage, crafted from ingredients sourced daily from canal-side markets.': '每一道菜都讲述着泰国美食传统的故事，以每日从运河边市场采购的食材精心烹制。',
    'Each morning before the world wakes, saffron-robed monks walk silently along the Bangkok Noi Canal to receive alms from the local community.': '每天清晨，在世界苏醒之前，身着橘黄色袈裟的僧侣们沿着曼谷诺伊运河静静地行走，从当地社区化缘。',
    'Each programme is curated around your unique goals by your personal Wellness Navigator — daily treatments, private yoga, botanical nourishment, and canal-based wellness experiences designed to create lasting change.': '每个计划由您的专属健康导航师根据您的独特目标量身定制——每日疗程、私人瑜伽、植物滋养和运河健康体验，旨在创造持久的改变。',
    'Each room comes with its own yoga mat, and guests are warmly welcome to practice at any time — in the privacy of their room, on their terrace, or anywhere in our open canal-side spaces.': '每间客房均配备专属瑜伽垫，诚挚欢迎宾客随时练习——在私密的房间内、阳台上，或我们开放的运河边任何空间。',
    'Each venue at W1 Bangkoknoi offers a distinct atmosphere for your perfect day — from the grandeur of the ballroom to the intimate charm of the canal\'s edge.': 'W1 Bangkoknoi的每处场地都为您的完美日子提供独特的氛围——从宴会厅的宏伟气派到运河边的亲密魅力。',
    'Early check-in and late check-out available on request, subject to availability.': '可应要求提供提前入住和延迟退房，视客房状况而定。',
    'Early check-in requests can be accommodated subject to availability and may incur a fee.': '提前入住请求可根据客房状况满足，可能需要支付额外费用。',
    'Eight distinct sanctuaries along the Bangkok Noi Canal — from intimate Signature rooms to private canal villas and wellness retreats, each crafted for those who appreciate the extraordinary.': '沿曼谷诺伊运河分布的八处独特圣地——从温馨的标志性客房到私人运河别墅和健康疗愈庄园，每处均为欣赏非凡之美的人士精心打造。',
    'Elegant comfort with a touch of Thai refinement': '优雅舒适，融入泰式精致韵味',
    'Email Address *': '电子邮件地址 *',
    'Enquire Now': '立即咨询',
    'Events': '活动',
    'Every guest experience at W1 is a step in that repositioning. What matters most is that you feel the intention behind everything we do.': '每位宾客在W1的体验都是这一转变的一个步骤。最重要的是，您能感受到我们所做一切背后的用心。',
    'Every journey includes a dedicated Boat Butler who shares the history and stories of both canal banks, serves refreshments on board, and ensures your experience is as enriching as it is beautiful.': '每次旅程都配有专属游艇管家，为您讲述两岸的历史与故事，在船上提供茶点，确保您的体验既丰富又美好。',
    'Every meal and beverage celebrates Thai botanicals and herbal wisdom — from a cooling butterfly pea welcome tea to post-treatment botanical elixirs.': '每顿餐饮和饮品都彰显泰国植物与草本智慧——从清凉的蝶豆花迎宾茶到疗程后的植物精华饮品。',
    'Every meal and beverage celebrates Thai botanicals and herbal wisdom. Food at W1 is a joyful, vital connection to the land and the canal.': '每顿餐饮和饮品都彰显泰国植物与草本智慧。W1的美食是与土地和运河之间充满活力的愉悦连接。',
    'Every treatment at Palace Wellness is a journey — not simply a service.': 'Palace Wellness的每次疗程都是一段旅程——而非仅仅是一项服务。',
    'Executive board meetings and strategy off-sites': '董事会会议和战略规划异地会',
    'Experiences': '体验项目',
    'Explore a vast network of canals where thousands of people go about their daily lives — just the other side of the fence from modern Bangkok.': '探索广阔的运河网络，数以千计的人们在那里过着日常生活——就在现代曼谷另一侧的围栏旁。',
    'Explore the canalside community of Nonthaburi on two wheels. Our fat-tyre bikes are perfect for the flat canal paths.': '骑上两轮车探索暖武里的运河边社区。我们的宽胎自行车非常适合平坦的运河小径。',
