    'For the ultimate elite experience, couples can opt for an exclusive resort buy-out, transforming our private canal villas into a secluded, romantic sanctuary for the wedding party and guests.': '为了打造终极精英体验，新人可选择独家包场，将我们的私人运河别墅转变为婚礼队伍和宾客的世外桃源式浪漫圣地。',
