    'Purify and refresh in our traditional Thai herbal steam sanctuary — a deeply rooted practice using medicinal botanicals to open the pores, release tension, and restore respiratory clarity.': '在我们的传统泰式草本蒸汽圣地中净化和焕新——一种使用药用植物打开毛孔、释放紧张并恢复呼吸畅通的深根实践。',
    'Rates are subject to change without notice. The rate applicable to your reservation is the rate confirmed at the time of booking.': '价格如有变动，恕不另行通知。适用于您预订的价格是预订时确认的价格。',
