    'Reserve a Table': '预订餐桌',
    'Restaurant reservations at Thai Boran Restaurant & Bar and W1 Café are subject to availability. We request that guests notify us at least 24 hours in advance of any cancellations or changes.': 'Thai Boran餐厅酒吧和W1 Café的餐厅预订视供应情况而定。我们请求宾客提前至少24小时通知我们任何取消或更改。',
    'Restore your body and mind with a bespoke wellness treatment. Submit your preferences below and our therapists will design a personalised experience just for you.': '通过定制健康疗程修复您的身心。在下方提交您的偏好，我们的治疗师将专为您设计个性化体验。',
    'Romance elevated — a private whirlpool for two': '浪漫升华——专属双人私人按摩浴缸',
    'Room / Accommodation Enquiry': '客房/住宿查询',
    'Room Type Preference': '房型偏好',
    'Royal Thai Herbal Compress (90 min)': '泰式皇家草本热敷（90分钟）',
    'Royal Thai Herbal Compress from ฿2,500': '泰式皇家草本热敷起价 ฿2,500',
    'Royal Thai classics prepared with seasonal canal-side produce.': '以运河边时令食材烹制的泰式皇家经典菜肴。',
    'Sacred conch shell and blessed water provided': '提供神圣法螺和圣水',
    'Savour authentic Thai Boran — traditional Thai dishes reimagined with modern elegance. Our signature restaurant and bar, set on the historic Bangkok Noi Canal in Nonthaburi, is an invitation to slow down and discover.': '品味正宗Thai Boran——以现代优雅重新诠释的传统泰式菜肴。我们的招牌餐厅和酒吧坐落于暖武里历史悠久的曼谷诺伊运河畔，是放慢脚步、细细探寻的邀请。',
    'Seamlessly combined with Grand Ballroom or Canal Terrace reception': '与宴会厅或运河露台招待会无缝结合',
    'Select': '选择',
    'Select time': '选择时间',
    'Send relevant offers, packages, or updates (only if you have opted in)': '发送相关优惠、套餐或更新（仅在您选择接收的情况下）',
    'Service staff on board': '船上服务人员',
    'Set on the historic Bangkok Noi canal, we are an urban wellness sanctuary grounded in reality — built not on claims of transcendence but on the careful, consistent delivery of deeply restorative experiences.': '坐落于历史悠久的曼谷诺伊运河边，我们是一处立足现实的都市健康圣地——不以超凡脱俗的宣言为基础，而以精心、持续地提供深度恢复性体验为根本。',
    'Seven signature light bite menus, beautifully crafted to complement your daytime relaxation. Each dish is thoughtfully prepared to nourish without weighing you down.': '七款精心打造的标志性轻食菜单，与您的白天放松相得益彰。每道菜都经过精心准备，滋养身体而不增加负担。',
    'Single-origin Thai arabica brewed by our in-house baristas, alongside curated Thai herbal teas and signature cold-pressed juices.': '由内部咖啡师冲泡的单一产地泰国阿拉比卡咖啡，搭配精选泰国草本茶和标志性冷压果汁。',
    'Smart casual dress code. Reservations recommended, particularly for dinner and weekends. All dietary requirements accommodated with advance notice.': '智能休闲着装要求。建议预订，尤其是晚餐和周末。提前通知可满足所有饮食要求。',
    'Smoking is permitted only in designated outdoor areas.': '仅允许在指定户外区域吸烟。',
    'Spacious covered group deck': '宽敞有顶的团体甲板',
    'Special Occasion?': '特殊场合？',
    'Special Requests': '特殊要求',
    'Special Requests or Notes': '特殊要求或备注',
    'Special occasions: Let us know if you\'re celebrating a birthday, anniversary, or other milestone — we love to make your visit extra special.': '特殊场合：如果您正在庆祝生日、周年纪念或其他重要时刻，请告知我们——我们很乐意让您的到访格外特别。',
    'Standard Rate: Free cancellation up to 48 hours prior to arrival. Cancellations within 48 hours of arrival are non-refundable.': '标准价格：抵达前48小时内可免费取消。抵达前48小时内取消不予退款。',
