    'State-of-the-art audiovisual equipment and high-speed Wi-Fi throughout all venues': '所有场地均配备最先进的视听设备和高速Wi-Fi',
    'Step outside your suite and into your own private pool. Surrounded by tropical greenery and bathed in natural light, the Pool Suite is the perfect sanctuary for those who seek privacy, luxury, and pure indulgence.': '走出套房，进入您自己的私人泳池。被热带绿植环绕，沐浴在自然光中，泳池套房是寻求私密、奢华和纯粹享受的人士的完美圣地。',
    'Strategy sessions in canal-side meeting rooms': '运河边会议室内的战略会议',
    'Subject to applicable Thai data protection law (PDPA), you have the right to:': '根据适用的泰国数据保护法（PDPA），您有权：',
    'Submit your enquiry below and our team will confirm availability and tailor your perfect canal-side escape. We respond within 2 hours during hotel hours.': '在下方提交您的查询，我们的团队将确认可用性并为您量身定制完美的运河边休闲体验。在酒店服务时间内，我们将在2小时内回复。',
    'Suitable for large gatherings — our grandest ceremonial offering': '适合大型聚会——我们最盛大的仪式体验',
    'Temple tours by canal with tropical refreshments — a private butler experience on the water.': '运河寺庙游览，搭配热带茶点——水上私人管家体验。',
    'Thai Boran Restaurant': 'Thai Boran餐厅',
    'Thai Boran seated lunch': 'Thai Boran正式午餐',
    'Thai Boran – meaning "traditional Thai" in its most refined form – celebrates Thailand\'s rich culinary heritage through elevated renditions of beloved heirloom recipes.': 'Thai Boran——以最精致的形式意为"传统泰式"——通过对深受喜爱的传世秘方的升华演绎，庆祝泰国丰富的美食遗产。',
    'Thai Traditional Massage (60 min)': '泰式传统按摩（60分钟）',
    'Thai Traditional Massage (90 min)': '泰式传统按摩（90分钟）',
    'Thai Traditional Massage from ฿1,800': '泰式传统按摩起价 ฿1,800',
    'Thai cooking masterclasses using local canal-market produce, guided by our resident chefs.': '由我们的驻场厨师指导，使用当地运河市场食材的泰式烹饪大师课。',
    'The Bangkok Noi Canal is glassy at dawn. Borrow a stand-up paddle board or kayak from the hotel jetty and explore the calm waters at your own pace.': '曼谷诺伊运河在黎明时分如镜般平静。从酒店码头借用站立式桨板或皮划艇，按照自己的节奏探索宁静的水域。',
    'The canal is an active part of the healing, not just a view. We invite guests to slow down and align their breathing with the rhythm of the water.': '运河是疗愈过程的积极组成部分，而不仅仅是一道风景。我们邀请宾客放慢脚步，将呼吸与水的节奏相协调。',
    'The resort reserves the right to decline treatment if, in the opinion of our therapists, proceeding would be unsafe or inadvisable.': '如果在治疗师的判断下，继续进行疗程不安全或不明智，度假村保留拒绝疗程的权利。',
    'The resort reserves the right to request a credit card pre-authorisation or security deposit at check-in.': '度假村保留在办理入住时要求信用卡预授权或安全押金的权利。',
    'The resort\'s liability in all circumstances shall not exceed the total charges paid by the guest for the reservation.': '度假村在任何情况下的责任均不超过宾客为预订支付的总费用。',
    'The resort\'s private canal access and boat facilities are for the exclusive use of registered guests.': '度假村的私人运河通道和船只设施仅供登记注册的宾客专用。',
    'The shaded canal terrace and air-conditioned lounge are also available for private hire for intimate gatherings and corporate breakouts.': '有遮荫的运河露台和空调休息室也可供私人租用，用于亲密聚会和企业小组讨论。',
