    'These Terms & Conditions are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the Kingdom of Thailand.': '这些条款与条件受泰王国法律管辖并依照其解释。',
    'This venue is a future concept and is not yet operational. We look forward to welcoming you when it opens.': '此场地是未来概念，尚未运营。期待开业后欢迎您的光临。',
    'Three signature RLAX treatments — Thai Roots & Modern Rhythm / Wi-Thee Boran': '三种标志性RLAX疗程——泰国根源与现代节奏 / 传统方法',
    'Timeless Thai cuisine with modern flair, overlooking the canal at golden hour with handcrafted cocktails.': '永恒的泰式美食配以现代风格，俯瞰黄金时刻的运河，搭配手工调制鸡尾酒。',
    'Timeless Thai cuisine. Modern elegance.Unforgettable moments on the Bangkok Noi Canal.': '永恒泰式美食。现代优雅。曼谷诺伊运河上难忘的时刻。',
    'Timeless venues. Flawless execution.Unforgettable moments on the Bangkok Noi Canal.': '永恒场地。完美执行。曼谷诺伊运河上难忘的时刻。',
    'Tom Kha Gai Coconut Soup ฿280': '椰汁鸡汤 ฿280',
    'Traditional Khan Maak procession with offerings and ceremonial gifts': '传统坎玛克迎亲队伍，附供品和礼仪礼物',
