    'Treatment Type *': '疗程类型 *',
    'Treatment bookings at Palace Wellness Spa are subject to the following conditions:': 'Palace Wellness Spa的疗程预订须遵守以下条件：',
    'Treatments available for hotel guests and day visitors by reservation': '疗程凭预约向酒店住客和日间访客开放',
    'TripAdvisor': 'TripAdvisor',
    'True restoration does not require leaving the city —it means finding a different rhythm within it.': '真正的修复不需要离开城市——而是在城市中找到不同的节奏。',
    'Two nights in Deluxe or Luxury accommodation': '入住豪华或奢华客房两晚',
    'Unforgettable ceremonies on the Bangkok Noi Canal — intimate Thai traditions, grand ballroom receptions, and bespoke celebrations crafted for every love story.': '曼谷诺伊运河上令人难忘的仪式——亲密的泰国传统、宏伟的宴会厅招待会，以及为每一段爱情故事精心打造的定制庆典。',
    'Valid government-issued photo identification is required at check-in for all guests, as required by Thai law.': '根据泰国法律规定，所有宾客在入住时须出示有效的政府颁发带照片的身份证件。',
